{"id":"e89388793704338b","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-complex-differentiable.md","title":"Complex Differentiability","display":"df-complex-differentiable — Complex Differentiability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-complex-differentiable","aliases":["58-df-complex-differentiable","Complex Differentiability"],"display":"df-complex-differentiable — Complex Differentiability","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-complex-differentiable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-complex-differentiable</span><span>Complex Differentiability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-complex-differentiable — Complex Differentiability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\mathbb C\">\\(U\\subseteq\\mathbb C\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,z_0,\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\in V\">\\(f,z_0,\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\in V\\)</span>, where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\)</span> is the usual metric topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb C\">\\(\\mathbb C\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComplexDifferentiable}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ComplexDifferentiable}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Holomorphic}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Holomorphic}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}differentiable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ComplexDifferentiable}_S(f,U,z_0) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,U,\\mathbb C)\\land z_0\\in U\\land\n\\exists L\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall h\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\Bigl((0&lt;|h|&lt;\\delta\\land z_0+h\\in U)\\to\n\\left|\\frac{f(z_0+h)-f(z_0)}{h}-L\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}differentiable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ComplexDifferentiable}_S(f,U,z_0) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,U,\\mathbb C)\\land z_0\\in U\\land\n\\exists L\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall h\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\Bigl((0&lt;|h|&lt;\\delta\\land z_0+h\\in U)\\to\n\\left|\\frac{f(z_0+h)-f(z_0)}{h}-L\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}differentiable\\text{-}holomorphic} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Holomorphic}_S(f,U) \\leftrightarrow\nU\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,U,\\mathbb C)\\land\n\\forall z\\in U\\;\\mathrm{ComplexDifferentiable}_S(f,U,z)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}differentiable\\text{-}holomorphic} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Holomorphic}_S(f,U) \\leftrightarrow\nU\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,U,\\mathbb C)\\land\n\\forall z\\in U\\;\\mathrm{ComplexDifferentiable}_S(f,U,z)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Complex differentiability: stronger than real differentiability; requires limit to exist from all directions with same value</li>\n<li>Holomorphicity is asserted only on an open subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb C\">\\(\\mathbb C\\)</span>; the pointwise derivative relation itself remains meaningful relative to an arbitrary subset.</li>\n<li>CR equations: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_x = v_y\">\\(u_x = v_y\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_y = -v_x\">\\(u_y = -v_x\\)</span>; equivalent to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar{\\partial} f = 0\">\\(\\bar{\\partial} f = 0\\)</span></li>\n<li>Analytic: complex differentiable in neighborhood <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\implies\">\\(\\implies\\)</span> equals power series (Cauchy)</li>\n<li>Conformal: holomorphic + <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f&#39;(z) \\neq 0 \\implies\">\\(f&#39;(z) \\neq 0 \\implies\\)</span> preserves angles</li>\n<li>Gateaux differentiability: directional derivative only from complex directions</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ahlfors, Complex Analysis</li>\n<li>Conway, Functions of One Complex Variable</li>\n<li>Gamelin, Complex Analysis&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U\\subseteq\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"f,z_0,\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathbb C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComplexDifferentiable}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Holomorphic}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}differentiable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ComplexDifferentiable}_S(f,U,z_0) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,U,\\mathbb C)\\land z_0\\in U\\land\n\\exists L\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\n\\forall h\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\Bigl((0<|h|<\\delta\\land z_0+h\\in U)\\to\n\\left|\\frac{f(z_0+h)-f(z_0)}{h}-L\\right|<\\varepsilon\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}differentiable\\text{-}holomorphic} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Holomorphic}_S(f,U) \\leftrightarrow\nU\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,U,\\mathbb C)\\land\n\\forall z\\in U\\;\\mathrm{ComplexDifferentiable}_S(f,U,z)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"u_x = v_y","display":false},{"tex":"u_y = -v_x","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar{\\partial} f = 0","display":false},{"tex":"\\implies","display":false},{"tex":"f'(z) \\neq 0 \\implies","display":false}],"bytes":2048,"backlinks":[{"id":"d85f24c98c7d4149","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Holomorphic}_S$ (holomorphic predicate, see [[58-df-complex-differentiable]])"},{"id":"2e27b623be13cf38","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Holomorphic}_S(f,U)$ (see [[58-df-complex-differentiable]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","ancho